# Esoteric Duplicator: Bot1 sacrifices another artifact, a Black Lotus, for {B}{B}{B} while the Duplicator stays on the battlefield. The
# trigger resolves with the Lotus's mana paying {2}; at the next end step a token that's a copy of the Black Lotus (not of the
# Duplicator) is made, and the Duplicator is untouched. A Prismatic Vista Bot1 sacrifices (a land, no artifact) triggers nothing.

[Bot1 Deck]
Esoteric Duplicator
Black Lotus
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Prismatic Vista
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

